        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTestcase 1: We can select nodes 222 and 333. A2A_2A2​ is 6 and A3A_3A3​ is 777. The cost is ((6∣7)−(6&7))=7−6=1((6 | 7) - (6 \\& 7)) = 7 - 6 = 1((6∣7)−(6&7))=7−6=1.\nTestcase 2: We can select nodes 111, 222 and 333. A1=1,A2=2A_1 = 1, A_2 = 2A1​=1,A2​=2, and A3=4A_3 = 4A3​=4. The cost is ((1∣2∣4)−(1&2&4))=7−0=7((1|2|4) - (1 \\& 2 \\& 4)) = 7 - 0 = 7((1∣2∣4)−(1&2&4))=7−0=7. It can be proven that a lower cost is not possible."
